sonal pronoun: "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":1,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center>To be - Negative Form\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center>Negative Form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center>Contracted Negative Form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center> I <b>am not\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center> I<b>'m</b> not\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center>You <b>are not\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center>You <b>aren't\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center>He<b> is not\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center>He<b>isn't \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center>She<b> is not\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center>She <b>isn't\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center>It<b>is not\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center>It<b> isn't\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center>We<b> are not\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center>We<b> aren't \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center>They <b>are not\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<center>They<b> aren't\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "But, I'm not sure about the differences between software engineering and computer science. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "It isn't involved with software creation, it is more related to the research and extent of scientific knowledge."}, {"type": "example", "content": "It isn't a bad decision. "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Software Engineering vs. Computer Science and Systems Engineering"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "There are three different disciplines devoted to the computing process and everything that integrates it. Among these renowned disciplines you will find: <b>software engineering</b>, <b>computer science</b> and <b>systems engineering</b>. The functioning of computing programs, as well as hardware and software processes are common to all these disciplines. Let's see the differences and particularities of each one."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li><b>Software engineering</b>: a discipline that applies engineering principles to the design, creation, and implementation of software. </li></br> <li><b>Computer science</b>: a scientific and useful approach to process information and make calculations for communication purposes. </li></br> <li><b>Systems engineering</b>: an interdisciplinary area of engineering devoted to the design and management of complex engineering systems. </li></ul>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Software Engineering\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Computer Science\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"System Engineering\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Software engineers work with proven knowledge to create software designs that work. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Computer scientists research and extend scientific knowledge. They also prove the accuracy of algorithms.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"System engineers analyze and use interdisciplinary knowledge to produce physical systems.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It produces software in an economic and feasible way.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"They test theories to patent reliable computing principles.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Focused on functionality to solve problems and create physical systems with quality outputs requiring minimum cost and time.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Common inventions:  </span> Network distribution software for medical, industrial, military, communications, aerospace, business, scientific, and general computing applications.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Common inventions: </span> -Algorithmic trading for financial market. <br />  -A formal definition of computation. <br /> -Modern digital computer. <br /> -Artificial intelligence. <br /> -Simulation of various processes, including computational fluid  dynamics, physical, electrical, and electronic systems and circuits.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Common inventions: </span> -The Apollo program. <br /> -Systems engineering. <br /> -Techniques are used in complex projects such as spacecraft design, computer chip design, robotics, software integration, and bridge building.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "approach"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "method used for dealing with a specific subject"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Computer science is a scientific and useful approach for computer development. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n1le01ob04aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "develop"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to elaborate"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Well, software engineering is not an approach, but a 